ellatio, you should be excited (Oh, oh-oh)\n[01:38.58]'Cause when she come back to you, that's a million-dollar nut kiss (Oh-oh, mwah)\n[01:41.26]She ain't nothin' but a no-good, diamond-watchin' woman\n[01:43.82]Only love me 'cause she see Versace on my linens\n[01:46.56]Baby, I'm not God, so your sins are not forgiven\n[01:49.52]I can never lose, every day I wake up winnin'\n[01:51.84]Mama told me, \"Cut the bad ho's off with the scissors\" (Bad ho's off)\n[01:55.04]Make 'em disappear, call me Juice WRLD wizard, uh (Disappear)\n[01:57.80]Bae, I'm high off narcotics, so your name, I cannot remember (Uh)\n[02:00.40]Using opiates overly, openly fuckin' up my image, yeah\n[02:04.42]I grew up on all types, I'm talkin' 'bout music and girls, right?\n[02:10.12]I grew up on all types, I'm talkin' 'bout drugs, the weed and the pills\n[02:15.76]I grew up on all types, I'm talkin' 'bout music and ho's, right?\n[02:20.94]And clothes, I was overly exposed\n[02:22.90]Now I'm bearin' the fruits my mama planted, they done growed\n[02:25.80]Hell yeah, they done glowed up, I done glowed up\n[02:28.56]Oxycodone got me sewed up, gotta remain focused\n[02:31.10]And these groupie hoes bogus, everybody knows it\n[02:34.20]But they turn me to a poet with the love commotion\n[02:36.98]Blood, sweat, and tears, money parted it, Moses\n[02:39.88]Used to roll mid, now it's gas what I'm smokin' (What I'm smokin')\n[02:42.88]Like I farted, hit the gas, I'm in motion (I'm in motion), I departed\n[02:46.54]Wrist hangin' out the window, cost your apartment\n[02:49.72]This the brightest that my life ever been\n[02:51.90]I need diamonds all over for when it get dark again\n[02:54.70]Called my mama up and told her that the devil marchin' in\n[02:57.32]She sent me Bible verses, then I got distracted by some nudes from a sex worker (Sex worker)\n[03:01.52]Who am I to not text back? That's networking (Networking)\n[03:04.40]Who am I to lie about my life? I know the truth hurts (Truth hurts)\n[03:07.20]W